a cuando el jugador toca\nel tile de lava llamado \"myTile\".\nDetecta cuando un sprite de tipo Player toca la lava.</comment><value name=\"HANDLER_DRAG_PARAM_sprite\"><block type=\"argument_reporter_custom\" deletable=\"false\"><mutation typename=\"Sprite\"></mutation><field name=\"VALUE\">sprite</field></block></value><value name=\"kind\"><shadow type=\"spritekind\"><field name=\"MEMBER\">Player</field></shadow></value><value name=\"tile\"><shadow type=\"tileset_tile_picker\"><field name=\"tile\">assets.tile`myTile`</field></shadow></value><value name=\"HANDLER_DRAG_PARAM_location\"><block type=\"argument_reporter_custom\" deletable=\"false\"><mutation typename=\"tiles.Location\"></mutation><field name=\"VALUE\">location</field></block></value><statement name=\"HANDLER\"><block type=\"gameOver2\"><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"80\" w=\"160\">Termina el juego indicando derrota.</comment><value name=\"win\"><shadow type=\"toggleWinLose\"><field name=\"win\">false</field></shadow></value><next><block type=\"game_setgameovereffect\"><field name=\"effect\">effects.blizzard</field><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"80\" w=\"160\">Muestra un efecto visual de tormenta de nieve.</comment><value name=\"win\"><shadow type=\"toggleWinLose\"><field name=\"win\">false</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></statement></block><block type=\"spriteshittile\" x=\"20\" y=\"469\"><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"80\" w=\"160\">=========================================================\n3. EVENTO: EL JUGADOR TOCA EL PORTAL\n=========================================================\nEsta función se ejecuta cuando el jugador toca\nel tile llamado \"portal\".\nDetecta cuando un sprite de tipo Player toca el portal.</comment><value name=\"HANDLER_DRAG_PARAM_sprite\"><block type=\"argument_reporter_custom\" deletable=\"false\"><mutation typename=\"Sprite\"></mutation><field name=\"VALUE\">sprite2</field></block></value><value name=\"kind\"><shadow type=\"spritekind\"><field name=\"MEMBER\">